  # @option opts [Boolean] :business_days Set to &#x60;true&#x60; to add a &#x60;business_days&#x60; count. Days are counted by calendar date, start included and end excluded, unsigned; weekends follow the holiday calendar&#39;s country (Saturday/Sunday in 221 countries, Friday/Saturday in 18 such as SA, Sunday only in 8, Friday only in IR, Friday/Sunday in BN; Saturday/Sunday when no &#x60;holiday_country&#x60; is given) and holidays of the chosen calendar are skipped. Each endpoint&#39;s date is taken in its own zone when one is known (diff - from_*/to_* hints or a tz&#x3D;/ip&#x3D;/offset&#x3D; specifier; elapsed - source_*/compare_source_*), otherwise in UTC. Enabled by &#x60;true&#x60;, &#x60;1&#x60; or &#x60;yes&#x60; (case-insensitive); any other value leaves it off without an error.
